#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:4
msgid "Offline Installations and Upgrades"
msgstr "Instalações e Upgrades Offline"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:6
msgid ""
"For customers that have an appliance behind a firewall/proxy that does "
"not allow downloads from our Amazon download site, you can add the "
"supplemental package to add the needed packages the standard Morpheus "
"installer would have downloaded."
msgstr "Para clientes que têm um appliance atrás de um firewall/proxy que não permite downloads do nosso site de download na Amazon, você pode adicionar o pacote complementar para incluir os pacotes necessários que o instalador padrão do Morpheus teria baixado."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page covers offline installation and application-package upgrades "
"for the |morpheus| appliance. It does not supply Ubuntu base-OS updates "
"for the HPE Morpheus Manager QCOW2 image. For restricted-network and "
"fully disconnected APT repository models, see :doc:`Morpheus Manager Base"
" OS Updates </getting_started/maintenance/manager_os_updates>`. Offline "
"HKS cluster provisioning uses a separate image-server workflow; see "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hks_offline_provisioning`."
msgstr "Esta página cobre instalação offline e upgrades de pacotes da aplicação para o appliance |morpheus|. Ela não fornece atualizações do SO base Ubuntu para a imagem QCOW2 do HPE Morpheus Manager. Para modelos de repositório APT em rede restrita e totalmente desconectada, consulte :doc:`Morpheus Manager Base OS Updates </getting_started/maintenance/manager_os_updates>`. O provisionamento offline de cluster HKS usa um fluxo de trabalho separado de servidor de imagens; consulte :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hks_offline_provisioning`."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:11
msgid "Offline Installation Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos de Instalação Offline"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:13
msgid ""
"NTP should be correctly configured and the server is able to connect to "
"the NTP server in the ntp.conf file"
msgstr "O NTP deve estar corretamente configurado e o servidor deve conseguir se conectar ao servidor NTP no arquivo ntp.conf"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:14
msgid ""
"The OS package repositories should be configured to use local LAN "
"repository servers or the server should be able to receive packages from "
"the configured repositories. For a Manager QCOW2 appliance, expose only "
"the update content validated by HPE for the installed release."
msgstr "Os repositórios de pacotes do SO devem ser configurados para usar servidores de repositório LAN locais, ou o servidor deve conseguir receber pacotes dos repositórios configurados. Para um appliance Manager QCOW2, exponha apenas o conteúdo de atualização validado pela HPE para a release instalada."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:15
msgid ""
"The standard Morpheus and supplemental packages must be downloaded from "
"another system and transferred to the Morpheus Appliance server"
msgstr "Os pacotes padrão do Morpheus e os pacotes complementares devem ser baixados de outro sistema e transferidos para o servidor do Morpheus Appliance"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:16
msgid "The supplemental package is additive, the full installer is also required"
msgstr "O pacote complementar é aditivo; o instalador completo também é necessário"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:18
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:56
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:92
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:18
msgid ""
"The supplemental package is linked 1-to-1 to the appliance release. For "
"example the supplemental package for 4.2.1-1 should be used with the "
"appliance package 4.2.1-1"
msgstr "O pacote complementar está vinculado 1 para 1 à release do appliance. Por exemplo, o pacote complementar para 4.2.1-1 deve ser usado com o pacote do appliance 4.2.1-1"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:21
msgid "Offline Install"
msgstr "Instalação Offline"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:24
msgid "Ubuntu/Debian"
msgstr "Ubuntu/Debian"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:26
msgid ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package and the Supplemental"
" packages on to the appliance server:"
msgstr "Baixe o pacote regular do Morpheus Appliance e os pacotes Supplemental no servidor do appliance:"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:28
msgid ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\n"
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:33
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:69
msgid "Install the both the Appliance package AND the Supplemental package."
msgstr "Instale o pacote do Appliance E o pacote Supplemental."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:35
msgid ""
"sudo dpkg -i morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\n"
"sudo dpkg -i morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:40
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:76
msgid ""
"Set the Morpheus UI appliance url (if needed, hostname will be "
"automatically set)."
msgstr "Defina a URL do appliance da Morpheus UI (se necessário, o hostname será definido automaticamente)."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:42
msgid ""
"# edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configured correctly by "
"default)\n"
"\n"
"sudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:48
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:84
msgid "Reconfigure the appliance to install required packages"
msgstr "Reconfigure o appliance para instalar os pacotes necessários"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:50
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:86
msgid "sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:54
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:90
msgid ""
"The Chef run should complete successfully. There is a small pause when "
"Chef runs the resource remote_file[package_name] action create while Chef"
" verifies the checksum. After the reconfigure is complete, the morpheus-"
"ui will start and be up in a few minutes."
msgstr "A execução do Chef deve ser concluída com sucesso. Há uma pequena pausa quando o Chef executa o recurso remote_file[package_name] action create enquanto o Chef verifica o checksum. Após a reconfiguração ser concluída, o morpheus-ui será iniciado e estará disponível em alguns minutos."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:56
msgid ""
"Tail the morpheus log file located at /var/log/morpheus/morpheus-"
"ui/current with the command ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` and look "
"for the Morpheus ascii logo to know when the morpheus-ui is up."
msgstr "Acompanhe o arquivo de log do morpheus localizado em /var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/current com o comando ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` e procure o logo ascii do Morpheus para saber quando o morpheus-ui estiver no ar."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:60
msgid "CentOS/RHEL"
msgstr "CentOS/RHEL"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:62
msgid ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package and the matching "
"Supplemental package on to the Appliance server:"
msgstr "Baixe o pacote regular do Morpheus Appliance e o pacote Supplemental correspondente no servidor do Appliance:"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:64
msgid ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\n"
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-"
"appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:71
msgid ""
"sudo rpm -i morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\n"
"sudo rpm -i morpheus-appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:78
msgid ""
"#Edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configured correctly by "
"default)\n"
"\n"
"sudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:92
msgid ""
"Tail the morpheus-ui log file with ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` and "
"look for the Morpheus ascii logo to know when the morpheus-ui is up."
msgstr "Acompanhe o arquivo de log do morpheus-ui com ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` e procure o logo ascii do Morpheus para saber quando o morpheus-ui estiver no ar."

